WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Dozens of men
in powerful positions

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
have been accused
of sexual harassment lately,

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:05.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
and many of them
have made public apologies.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here to comment
is one of our writers,

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.608 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:12.078 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.279 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hi!

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hi, Amber!
-Hi, Seth!

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:20.887
Now, Seth, I've heard a lot
of men apologizing lately.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I want to talk about
how those apologies

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:28.228
have inspired me,
and what I've learned from them.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.329 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Thwak! ]

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:30.530 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.300
-You just...
You just punched me in the face.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I categorically
deny those allegations.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.273 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Amber...

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:44.077 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.146 size:75% position:38% line:92%
You just punched me.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did I?
That doesn't sound like me.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:49.449 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.483 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Anyone who knows me

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
would say
that's very out of character.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber, you came out here,
you sat down,

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.924 line:92%
and you punched me in the face!

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I remember those events
differently.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:01.661 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Amber!

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:05.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry...
that your face feels punched.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.666 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:07.534 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-That's not an apology.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, it was
a different time back then.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.006 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:15.708 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-It was 30 seconds ago!

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.477 line:92%
And you punched me in the face!

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:20.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Me?
Punch someone in the face?

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:24.017 size:81% position:41%
Look, I've always been
a supporter of faces.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:24.984 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:28.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
Some of my best friends
have faces.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:30.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber, you punched me
in the face.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:32.759
It's wrong,
and when we do something wrong,

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.727 size:78% position:39%
the right thing to do
is apologize clearly

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
and sincerely
and without caveat.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.032 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You're right.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:39.699 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Breathes deeply ]

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:45.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did punch Seth Meyers
in the face, and I am sorry.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:47.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess
I was hesitant to apologize,

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:51.177
because then everyone would know
that I'm a dirty face-puncher.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:51.711 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.047 size:88% position:44%
And now, because people
know I'm a face-puncher,

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:57.484 size:84% position:42%
there are certain jobs
that I just can't have,

00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:01.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
like movie producer
or "Today Show" host

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:03.356 line:92%
or Senator from Minnesota.

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:03.890 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:08.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I can still
be a Senator from Alabama!

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.064 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Vote Amber Ruffin, baby!

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.632 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.434 line:92%
-Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.171 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

